    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8305" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεξ-έταστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not searched out, not
				inquired into</i> or <i>examined,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				4.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				21.218
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>without inquiry</i> or <i>investigation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἀ. βίος οὐ βιωτός ἀνθρώπῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ap.</u>
					38a
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.550
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.94d
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
